{"title":"Aspen Fir Artificial Christmas Trees","description":"\u003ch3\u003eBring Home the Elegance of Aspen Fir Artificial Christmas Trees\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eExperience the beauty of one of our most luxurious and realistic artificial Christmas tree collections with the Aspen Fir from Carol's Christmas Conifers. Inspired by the Pinus Aristata native to the Aspen region, the Aspen Fir is thoughtfully designed to capture the rich greenery, fullness, and natural structure of a freshly cut evergreen while offering the convenience and durability of a premium artificial Christmas tree.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eAvailable in both pre-lit and unlit options, the Aspen Fir collection comes in 7.5' and 9' options, making it ideal for living rooms, open spaces, and homes looking to create a statement making holiday display.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eWhy choose the Aspen Fir?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eThe Aspen Fir is designed for those who want the look and feel of a luxury, ultra-realistic artificial Christmas tree. Its dense branch construction and rich evergreen tones create a full and elegant silhouette that closely resembles a natural evergreen found in mountain landscapes. With its \u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003epremium foliage, the Aspen Fir creates a lush appearance that feels refined, timeless, and grand.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-section-id=\"1m1eqah\" data-start=\"1735\" data-end=\"1794\"\u003eIs the Aspen Fir a realistic artificial Christmas tree?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1796\" data-end=\"2055\"\u003eYes. The Aspen Fir is considered one of our most realistic artificial Christmas tree collections. Designed with high-quality PE foliage and carefully crafted branch tips, the Aspen Fir offers a lifelike appearance that remains beautiful season after season, making it an excellent alternative to a fresh-cut Christmas tree.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-section-id=\"1pjqur7\" data-start=\"2252\" data-end=\"2308\"\u003eWhat decorating style works best with the Aspen Fir?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eThe Aspen Fir pairs beautifully with traditional, elegant, and luxury-inspired holiday décor. Its full silhouette provides ample space for ornaments, ribbon, garland, and statement tree toppers, while its realistic greenery complements both classic and modern color palettes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-section-id=\"obtv8b\" data-start=\"2758\" data-end=\"2806\"\u003eIs the Aspen Fir available pre-lit or unlit?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2808\" data-end=\"2936\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eYes. The Aspen Fir collection is available in both pre-lit and unlit options to accommodate decorating preferences. \u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eOur pre-lit Aspen Fir trees feature professionally installed lighting designed to provide a warm and elegant glow throughout the tree, while our unlit options allow for complete customization with your preferred holiday lights and décor.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv data-is-intersecting=\"true\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-WEB:612c1bef-7869-42c7-9d00-a5cb4a61c3a0-10\" class=\"\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"relative w-full overflow-visible\"\u003e\n\u003csection data-turn=\"assistant\" data-scroll-anchor=\"false\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-20\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-WEB:612c1bef-7869-42c7-9d00-a5cb4a61c3a0-10\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:612c1bef-7869-42c7-9d00-a5cb4a61c3a0-10\" dir=\"auto\" class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [\u0026amp;:has([data-writing-block])\u0026gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm\/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg\/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg\/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group\/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv data-turn-start-message=\"true\" class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+\u0026amp;]:mt-1\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-5\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-id=\"8a8d8107-ebaa-445b-8498-5116f1460158\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" tabindex=\"0\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"368\" data-start=\"0\"\u003ePre-lit Aspen Fir trees feature both warm white and multicolor lighting options that can be easily controlled with the included Carol's Christmas Conifers remote. Multiple lighting functions allow you to customize your holiday display with steady, flashing, and fading effects in both warm white and multicolor modes, including combined lighting displays for added versatility.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-is-only-node=\"\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-end=\"541\" data-start=\"370\"\u003eEach remote also includes built-in timer and dimmer functions, making it easy to customize brightness levels and automate your tree lighting throughout the holiday season.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/section\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-section-id=\"1w0uqtp\" data-start=\"3177\" data-end=\"3225\"\u003eIs the Aspen Fir easy to assemble and store?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3227\" data-end=\"3453\"\u003eYes. The Aspen Fir is designed with convenience and durability in mind. Its hinged branch construction allows for a quicker and more efficient setup process while helping create a naturally full appearance with minimal effort.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3227\" data-end=\"3453\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eEach tree includes a sturdy stand, complimentary setup gloves for comfortable branch shaping and fluffing, and a complimentary storage bag for convenient after-season storage and protection.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3227\" data-end=\"3453\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eExplore the full Aspen Fir collection to find a premium artificial Christmas tree designed to bring exceptional realism, luxurious fullness, and timeless holiday beauty into your home season after season.\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"7-5-foot-aspen-fir-tree-unlit","title":"7.5' Aspen Fir Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eMore than “naturally beautiful,” the Aspen Fir captures the true essence of the Pinus Aristata, its natural counterpart native to the Aspen region. Expertly crafted for stunning realism, it transforms your home into a winter wonderland, offering timeless beauty, effortless convenience, and holiday magic year after year.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Unlit","offer_id":41404954902728,"sku":"ASPF-T7.5-U","price":699.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/aspen-fir-artificial-christmas-tree_36523532-ffea-4019-a061-87e7f7ddf634.jpg?v=1718158652"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-aspen-fir-tree-led","title":"7.5' Aspen Fir Tree with 1400 Warm White \u0026 Multi-Color LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eMore than “naturally beautiful,” the Aspen Fir captures the true essence of the Pinus Aristata, its natural counterpart native to the Aspen region. Expertly crafted for stunning realism, it transforms your home into a winter wonderland, offering timeless beauty, effortless convenience, and holiday magic year after year.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ LED","offer_id":41404956442824,"sku":"ASPF-T7.5-L","price":999.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/AspenFir.png?v=1714663666"},{"product_id":"9-foot-aspen-fir-tree-unlit","title":"9' Aspen Fir Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eMore than “naturally beautiful,” the Aspen Fir captures the true essence of the Pinus Aristata, its natural counterpart native to the Aspen region. Expertly crafted for stunning realism, it transforms your home into a winter wonderland, offering timeless beauty, effortless convenience, and holiday magic year after year.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"9' \/ Unlit","offer_id":41404957130952,"sku":"ASPF-T9-U","price":999.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/aspen-fir-artificial-christmas-tree_b91320a1-4373-4e43-841b-56e5bc7c77e0.jpg?v=1718158921"},{"product_id":"9-foot-aspen-fir-tree-led","title":"9' Aspen Fir Tree with 2000 Warm White \u0026 Multi-Color LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eMore than “naturally beautiful,” the Aspen Fir captures the true essence of the Pinus Aristata, its natural counterpart native to the Aspen region. Expertly crafted for stunning realism, it transforms your home into a winter wonderland, offering timeless beauty, effortless convenience, and holiday magic year after year.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"9' \/ LED","offer_id":41404958179528,"sku":"ASPF-T9-L","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/AspenFir_fffc4103-c993-4c79-a3e4-2f0ec7d26b56.png?v=1714663616"}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/collections\/AspenFir_324c661c-a433-4af2-98b3-06b6b16ae9bd.png?v=1761157301","url":"/\/collections\/aspen-fir-trees.oembed","provider":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","version":"1.0","type":"link"}